WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Those creatures who cannot die...

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.300
They are called “Ajin”.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.300
Those creatures don’t realize they’re Ajin...

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.300
...until they’ve died once.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.300
That’s how it was for me, too.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.300
Please, Yuusuke!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.300
If I fail this test I won’t be able to pass the class.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.300
If you realize that, why don’t you stop skipping class and pay attention?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:21.300
Please!  I’m relying on your notes, come on, please?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.100
I guess I have no choice...

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.300
Alright!

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:29.300
H-Hey, what about the notes?

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.300
I have a lecture to go to now. Wait till I’m done.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.300
Lecture?  What lecture?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.300
The lecture that you’re borrowing the notes from.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:38.500
Ah, haha...

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:50.370
Is this old game any good?  I shouldn’t have downloaded this.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.600
Shinya, what are you doing?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:53.650
Not much...

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:58.200
Great, then you come too! We’re having a birthday party at our house now.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.600
At your place?

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.600
Aw, come on...

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:04.200
Sorry, but I’m waiting for Yuusuke.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.600
Sorry to make you wait!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.100
What were you doing? You’re late.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.600
I’m sorry! I just got out of a meeting.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.600
Can you come as well Shinya?

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.600
Oh, uh, are you going too, Emi?

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.100
This guy says he has a date with Yuusuke.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:22.870
Is that right?

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.200
Well then, see you later!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.600
I guess I will come to the party after all.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.200
Huh? But...

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.200
I mean, that is after I drop by my house.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:35.200
If that’s the case, we’ll go ahead so hurry up!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.100
Okay.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.600
I guess I’ll see you later!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.500
Sorry, I feel a cold coming on
so I’m heading home early.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.700
Sorry, Yuusuke.
Sorry, I feel a cold coming on
so I’m heading home early.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.120
Sorry, I feel a cold coming on
so I’m heading home early.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.020
Sent

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.200
Well, I’m drinking, so I better take the train.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.070
Wait for me, Emi!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.400
Come on... I better let them know I’m on my way.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.600
Huh?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.600
No way...

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.600
I definitely missed the train now.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.600
If I do drink, maybe they'll let me stay over.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.600
For real?

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.600
If I don’t hurry...

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.800
Damn it, guess I’ll use a back road.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.800
Alright!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.000
Let’s go!

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.200
Does this mean... I’m a monster?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.500
Ajin?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.000
I’m an Ajin?

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.200
No, wait. Calm down.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.600
It’s okay. No one saw me.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.600
Hide the evidence.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.600
If no one finds out, I can stay human.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.600
It’s okay. It’s okay.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.600
Stay calm.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.000
Alright.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.600
No one saw me, so it’s fine.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.600
Shit, why does this happen to me?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.600
Why? Why did this have to happen?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:12.200
If only I hadn’t taken my motorcycle... If only I hadn’t gone home first...

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.110
No, if only I hadn’t broken my promise to Yuusuke in the first place...

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:16.600
Sorry, I feel a cold coming on
so I’m heading home early.
