so I’m heading home early.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.000
Emi

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:25.600
Hey, Shinya, where are you?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:26.600
Uh...

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:31.600
You’re still not here yet? I’ve been waiting for you this whole time!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:35.600
Sorry, I think I’m catching a cold.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.100
I was going to contact Ryouta, but...

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:38.590
It’s not Ryouta that’s waiting for you.  I...
I was going to contact Ryouta, but...

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:45.100
It’s not Ryouta that’s waiting for you.  I...

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:45.250
Hey, Emi.
It’s not Ryouta that’s waiting for you.  I...

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.600
Hey, Emi.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.760
Ah, who are you talking to?

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.100
I’m waiting for you, so come over, okay?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:08:00.600
There’s no way... I can go.

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:03.900
Just hurry up and get well soon!
Okay, don’t worry about it.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:08.600
<i>Okay, don’t worry about it. Just hurry up and get well soon!</i>
Just hurry up and get well soon!
Okay, don’t worry about it.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.370
Just hurry up and get well soon!
Okay, don’t worry about it.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:15.600
This... Yuusuke!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.600
It’s okay, it’s not as if there are a lot of Ajin.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.600
As long as there isn’t any crucial evidence no one will find out.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:37.600
Ajin are immortal creatures that were discovered over a decade ago.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:43.600
The first Ajin was confirmed during conflict in Africa and captured by the U.S. army.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.600
A new, immortal creature.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:54.600
Ajin were proven to really exist and now are the subjects of various research experiments.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.400
Experiments...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.600
You've got to be kidding me.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:09.600
It’s okay, I’m fine. No one knows.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.600
I hid the evidence.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:17.900
I made my motorcycle look like it was illegally dumped, and the rain washed away the blood.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:21.100
The only problem is...

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:25.100
This indisputable evidence that I’m an Ajin.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.190
As long as this isn’t found...

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.600
Shinya... Are you home?

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.100
Yuusuke...

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.600
If you’re not home, just say so!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.600
I should be fine if I just act normal.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:07.100
If it's not discovered, I can still remain human.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.600
Hey, you missed class because of a cold?

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.100
Uh.. yeah.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.100
I bought you pudding, are you surprised?

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.550
Huh? No, I’m not really surprised.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.100
It’s my treat.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.600
Ah, Yuusuke. I’m still not feeling that well.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.600
I’d feel bad if you caught my cold.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.600
Sorry, but...

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.300
Shinya, why are you crying?

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:37.300
I...

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:44.700
Eh, What is this?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:46.590
Here, did something happen?

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.600
Grant Pharmaceutical Tissues
Here, did something happen?

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.300
Here, did something happen?

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.000
No, nothing at all.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.600
Nah, something happened, didn’t it?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.600
How many years do you think I’ve been your friend?

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.200
Yuusuke...

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.600
The truth is... I’m...

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.300
I’m...

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.600
I’m sorry, please go home.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:20.700
Shinya...

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.000
Please.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.600
What was I doing, thinking of giving myself away?

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.600
What was that about ‘acting normal’?

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:41.600
You just hoped that seeing your friend’s face would make you feel better.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.100
I don’t think I can handle this.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.600
Is it impossible for a monster to live as a human?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.600
No, don’t give up.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:12:00.600
As long as they don’t find this... as long as I can dispose of this-

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.820
I’ll remain human.

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.500
I’ll bury it deep in the mountains.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:09.900
If I do that, I can live as a human.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.800
What's that? A shadow?

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.600
No, a hallucination?

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.600
I’ll... remain... human.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.600
This is bad, I’m already going crazy!

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:41.600
Save me... someone... save me!!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.100
Ah... I’ll be exposed!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.600
Shinya!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.600
Are you really okay, Shinya?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:59.600
The hospital... No, before that, you should tell your aunt and uncle.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.600
At this rate...

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.600
I won’t be able to hold it together.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.600
If you want, I’ll call for you.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:13.600
Yuusuke... he might be on my side.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:19.600
If I'm sold out... if it’s Yuusuke...

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.500
I wouldn't mind.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.600
Yuusuke...

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.600
The truth is, I'm a...

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.040
Aji-

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:34.600
That face, there’s no mistake. It’s you isn’t it.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.200
What? Who are you?

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:39.600
I’m Kido, from the Ajin Management Committee.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.600
Shinya Nakamura.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:48.600
In accordance with special measures concerning Ajin, we're taking you into custody.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.600
How did they find out? I’m carrying the evidence with me!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.600
Huh? Shinya, what do they mean, Ajin?

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.600
To forget something like this...

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.000
You really are a monster.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:32.600
That night... To think that I didn’t realize that my head had regenerated.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:39.600
I haven’t been myself... for a long time!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:45.600
Kill and then restrain them. That’s the basic theory on capturing an Ajin.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.100
Eh?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.250
Begin.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:08.600
Yuusuke!!

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.600
Shinya...

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:13.600
Run...

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.600
Wh-What did you say?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.600
Hey, Mr. Kido-

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.390
Keep shooting!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.400
It’s fine as long as we get results, we'll cover this up!

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.400
Another...hallucination?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.600
Shinya... run.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:50.100
All of you... I’ll kill-

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.800
Hmm, damn experimental animal, giving us trouble.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.200
Now we don’t have to worry. Take him into custody.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:11.600
Take care of this before he begins reviving.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.600
Yes, sir.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.600
I’ll kill you.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.700
Did you say something?

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.100
No, nothing.

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.600
What the...?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.190
They didn’t say anything about this!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.200
I’ll kill you.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.600
Shoot it!!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.600
I didn’t hear anything about this!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:46.600
Other than being immortal aren’t Ajin supposed to be the same as humans!?

00:16:56.600 --> 00:17:01.600
It can’t be... is Shinya Nakamura a special kind of Ajin?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:08.600
I did it... this discovery is a huge achievement!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.600
Yuusuke...  I’m sorry.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.000
But... thanks to you...

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:44.900
Run... Shinya.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.600
Yeah, I got it.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:55.600
I called you for one reason only. It’s about the case regarding Nakamura Shinya, a different species.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:18:01.400
Investigate and clarify what happened. Prepare countermeasures if necessary.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.350
Just spare me the panic, Tosaki.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.600
Understood, Minister.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:13.000
Damn. To think with this job I’d have to deal with a corpse...

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.600
If only we had an Ajin on our side.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.200
Wait.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:24.540
There was a case of an unconfirmed Ajin in Hyogo.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.600
Tainaka Youko
