Tainaka Youko

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.600
Neither my face nor my name are coming up.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:40.100
Are they afraid I might summon that thing again?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:48.600
In the end... what in the world are Ajin?

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:53.600
Are the other Ajin different from me?

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.600
Well, I guess it doesn’t really matter.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.570
Okay, where to?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.600
The station, please.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.600
